    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Day's Work</strong> is a wholesome exploration adventure set in a small open world where you can do things at your own pace. Every workday features a unique map, but always with the same friendly characters, allowing you to explore different solutions to their problems and uncover all the secrets.<strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvesting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabbits...</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Day's Work</strong> is a wholesome exploration adventure set in a small open world where you can do things at your own pace. Every workday features a unique map, but always with the same friendly characters, allowing you to explore different solutions to their problems and uncover all the secrets.<strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvesting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabbits...</p></li></ul>",
